<title>BARBADOS: CRICKET-BARBADOS V INDIA MATCH ENDS IN DRAW.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-BARBADOS V INDIA MATCH ENDS IN DRAW.</headline>
<dateline>BRIDGETOWN 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The three-day between Barbados and India ended in a draw at Kensington Oval on Monday.</p>
<p>Scores: India 210 and 166-5; Barbados 338-4 declared.</p>
</text>
